# Nothing in this list belongs in an image or a build context.
#
# Without this file `COPY . .` in the web build stage carried the developer's .env files and
# the EC2 deploy key into an image layer, and shipped a multi-hundred-megabyte node_modules
# to the daemon on every build.

# Secrets and credentials
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.*.example
*.pem
*.key
**/private-uploads

# Dependencies and build output — always rebuilt inside the image
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# VCS, tooling and local noise
.git
.github
.claude
*.log
**/.DS_Store
1st.md
deploy-ec2.sh
